<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals total 1.77 mln bags to date.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals total 1.77 mln bags to date.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia 1996/97 cocoa arrivals totalled 1,772,100 million 60-kg bags by the week ending October 13 compared with 1,085,493 bags by October 15 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said.</p>
<p>Arrivals in the three weeks from September 23 to October 13 were as follows in 60-kg bags.</p>
<p> WEEK		  1996/97	     1995/96	    1994/95</p>
<p> Sept 23-29	   43,819		31,306	     83,140</p>
<p> Sept 30-Oct 6	43,356		28,109	     69,008</p>
<p> Oct 7-13	     37,502		35,524	     89,249</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
